impl.files:
All work is in the worktree C:\Users\Surface\.t3\worktrees\hospitalmanagementsystem\wp07 (branch wp/0.7-design-system). I made no git writes.

New, frontend/apps/web:
- index.html: lang and dir are set at run time; an empty title (filled from the catalogue); referrer no-referrer; an empty data: icon.
- vite.config.ts:
  - the `hms-demo-module` resolveId plugin swaps src/demo/selected.ts (null) for src/demo/index.ts only when VITE_HMS_DEMO is exactly '1';
  - built pages get a Content-Security-Policy meta element: default-src 'none', own origin only, data: for images and fonts, and the two style elements React Aria adds, allowed by sha256 hash;
  - servers listen on 127.0.0.1 only;
  - exports isDemoBuild, DEMO_MODULE_FILES and CONTENT_SECURITY_POLICY.
- src/main.tsx (entry point), src/zod-jitless.ts (stops Zod's `new Function` probe, which the CSP forbids), src/env.d.ts, src/app.css (logical CSS only).
- src/app/: services.tsx (one set of services per window, plus the hooks), create-services.ts, app.tsx.
- src/routing/:
  - static-data.ts: augments StaticDataRouteOption so `clinical: boolean` is required by type; optional titleKey;
  - route-tree.tsx: createAppRouteTree / createAppRouter, code-based routes `__root__`, `/` and the pathless `_clinical` layout (registered only when it has children); unknown addresses go to `/`;
  - clinical-layout.tsx: renders PatientBanner and the "Close patient record" control, the chooser when there is no patient, and nothing patient-specific while the address and the context disagree;
  - search.ts: a string-only search format (Zod validated) for locale, density and patient.
- src/patient/:
  - directory.ts: the directory interface; production has an empty one;
  - patient-queries.ts: TanStack Query keys ['patient', id, ...], keepOnlyPatients, a client with no network mode, no retry and no refetch;
  - patient-context-store.ts: applies ui-core's transition; modal state comes from the guard's holder kind; random v4 UUID idempotency keys from getRandomValues; prunes the cache after every transition; requestPatient;
  - use-patient-url-sync.ts: the address is a request, never a selection;
  - switch-confirmation.tsx: the §2.2 confirmation, an alertdialog with confirm validity asked of the machine through enabledTransitions;
  - patient-chooser.tsx: React Aria GridList of PatientIdentity.
- src/frame/:
  - app-frame.tsx: LocaleProvider from ?locale=, ModalStackProvider, DensityProvider (?density=), React Aria router, skip link, nav, command palette, language picker, density control, patient-context status region, switch confirmation, demo watermark, document title, focus-time user check;
  - language-picker.tsx;
  - demo-watermark.tsx.
- src/demo/:
  - demo-module.ts (types);
  - selected.ts (null; what every build gets by default);
  - index.ts: the demo module, with the synthetic directory, user `user-synthetic-demo`, simulated authenticator and an accept-all simulated submitter; `/demo/banner` under `_clinical`; ?fixture=<id> is redirected with replace to ?patient=<id>;
  - demo-banner-page.tsx: SignButton ×2, SignDialog (rejectedFocusTarget = the banner's close control, contextDeps = store.deps), the fixture chooser;
  - fixtures.ts: 25 Zod-validated synthetic fixtures, each with provenance synthetic and an `expect`, covering every §5 case;
  - synthetic-photo.png: an abstract pattern, not a face, 554 bytes, generated by a script outside the repo.

New tests, frontend/apps/web/test:
- route-tree.test.ts: describe 'banner-present-on-every-clinical-route', 7 tests;
- route-audit.ts;
- harness.tsx;
- demo-fixtures.test.ts: 30 tests;
- patient-query-cache.test.ts: 7 tests;
- patient-address-is-a-request.test.tsx: 7 tests.

